  {
   "id": "o72-jp-regex-spaces",
   "about": "A DENY_UNLESS_PERMIT rule `resource.items[?(@.b =~ /[ 0 ]/)].c CONTAINS 'v' OR resource.a == 'y'` over one element whose b is a space (space), 0 (zero) and x (other), each with c = v, a = n and a = y. The regular expression [ 0 ] is the class of a space and 0: true for space and zero, false for other. Without the spaces, [0] is false for space.",
   "resourceType": "PARITY_SUITE_O72_JP_REGEX_SPACES",
   "tenant": "parity-o72-jp-regex-spaces",
   "steps": [
    {
     "name": "upload",
